    },
    "message": "Select the research psychology model for generated Scenarios\n\nNew drafts from the initial Scenario generator now select\nmean-reverting-life-state-v1 instead of life-state-feedback-v1, with\nthe mean-reversion coefficients written out explicitly and the\nselection recorded in provenance. No coefficient values change.\n\nLegacy psychology models (causal-stress-v1, life-state-feedback-v1)\nstay installed so saved Runs and Checkpoints replay unchanged. To keep\nthem from being used by accident, prepare/run warn on stderr, the run\noutput reports psychology_model, and compare reports and renders the\npsychology model of both sides. The legacy mark lives in\ncontracts/policies.py rather than model-catalog.json because catalog\nentries are part of policy signatures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
